#: filterimagesdialog.cpp:106
msgid ""
"<p>Select here the filter type for your images:"
"<p><b>Add noise</b>: add artificial noise to an image."
"<p><b>Antialias</b>: remove pixel aliasing."
"<p><b>Blur</b>: blur the image with a Gaussian operator."
"<p><b>Despeckle</b>: reduces the speckle noise in an image while perserving "
"the edges of the original image."
"<p><b>Enhance</b>: apply a digital filter to enhance a noisy "
"image."
"<p><b>Median</b>: apply a median filter to an image."
"<p><b>Noise reduction</b>: reduce noise in an image. "
"<p><b>Sharpen</b>: sharpen the image with a Gaussian "
"operator."
"<p><b>Unsharp</b>: sharpen the image with an unsharp mask operator.<p>"
msgstr ""

